    {
      "type": "section",
      "text": {
        "type": "plain_text",
        "text": "1. Facilitate a structured mediation conversation with clear ground rules and documented outcomes.\n2. Issue a written summary of the conversation and expected behavioral changes to both parties.\n3. Check in with both parties individually within two weeks to assess whether the resolution is holding."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "text": {
        "type": "plain_text",
        "text": "If any part of the conflict involves comments about race, gender, age, disability, religion, or any protected characteristic — treat it as a potential harassment matter and contact HR immediately."
      }
